      <Comment source="pmngroup">This gene was heterologously expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; as a GST-fusion protein. The purified GST-fusion protein was shown to catalyze the synthesis of galactinol from &lt;i&gt;myo&lt;/i&gt;-inositol and UDP-galactose |CITS:[11846875]|.</Comment>
